# Niagara Drift, the control map: two drones. KNOB 1-2 drone I, KNOB 3-4 drone II on every page; page
# buttons (tap to stay, hold to peek); OCT- / OCT+; the black keys as switches, following the page; pitch
# link; the LFO on SELECT / ALGORITHM / PRESETS; MIDI; scenes on the white keys; save and reboot.
# Parameters (drone.h, 21 a drone): drone I 0..20 (pitch 0, X-Wave 1, width 2, mix 5, sub oct 6, cutoff 7,
# reso 8, mode 9, level 11, partner 12, osc tap 13, osc depth 14, osc LFO to 15, filter tap 16, filter
# depth 17, filter LFO to 18, noise 19, colour 20), drone II the same +21; then 42 cross-mod, 43 its amount,
# 44 hard sync, 45 pitch link, 46 link offset, 47 LFO rate, 48 Wave I, 49 Wave II, 50 Glide, 51 Fade, 55 Pulse,
# 56 its rate, 60 delay time, 61 repeats, 62 delay mix, 63 reverb mix, 64 reverb type, 65 delay LFO tap, 66 its
# depth.
# Pages: 0 Play 1 1 Play 2 2 Tone 1 3 Tone 2 4 Osc 5 LFO depths 6 LFO mods 7 Partner 8 Setup 1 9 Setup 2 10 Swell
# 11 Effects 1 12 Effects 2.
wav drone.wav
wait 300
shot stopped.png
expect view 0
expect playing 0
expect par0 5000
expect par21 5700
expect scenes 0
# PLAY: in over the default fade (1 s)
tap PLAY
wait 1600
expect fade 100
expect level0 >3
expect level1 >3
peakreset
wait 500
expect peak_db_max -0.5
expect peak_db_min -20
shot playing.png
# the Play page: KNOB 1 drone I's pitch (60 cents a detent; SEL held, a cent), KNOB 2 its cutoff,
# KNOB 3-4 drone II's
spin K1 2
expect par0 5120
press SEL
spin K1 -83
release SEL
expect par0 5037
expect view 0
spin K2 -5
expect par7 650
spin K3 1
expect par21 5760
spin K4 10
expect par28 780
wait 600
expect pitch0 5037
# a slow turn (clicks 500 ms apart) glides on between clicks, not in stairs: each click glides over the
# time since the one before, so 300 ms after the last it's still on its way (a 250 ms limit had it there)
turn K1 2 500
turn K1 1 10
wait 300
expect pitch0 >5160
expect pitch0 <5212
wait 300
expect pitch0 5217
spin K1 -3
expect par0 5037
wait 100
# HOME again: Play 2, each drone's resonance and level (KNOB 1-2 drone I, 3-4 drone II)
tap HOME
expect view 1
spin K4 -20
expect par32 50
wait 100
shot play2.png
tap HOME
expect view 0
# OCT- / OCT+: the MOVEMENT, every LFO depth together, 10 % a tap (100 % as set); OCT+ lit above 100 %
expect par75 50
tap OCT+
expect par75 55
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
expect par75 45
# held: on and on (a step on the press, then one every 120 ms after 400 ms: 6 in 0.9 s)
press OCT-
wait 900
release OCT-
expect par75 15
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect par75 50
# hold ENV to peek: the knobs are the Tone page's (drive, osc mix) while it's held, then back to Play
press ENV
expect view 2
spin K1 20
expect par10 40
release ENV
expect view 0
# a long hold without turning is a peek too
press EDIT
wait 600
release EDIT
expect view 0
# tap ENV: Tone stays; again: Tone 2, KNOB 1-2 drone I's Noise and Colour, 3-4 drone II's (Colour: white 0,
# pink 1, pink to start); again: Tone
tap ENV
expect view 2
spin K2 10
expect par5 40
tap ENV
expect view 3
expect par20 1
spin K1 25
expect par19 25
spin K2 -1
expect par20 0
spin K2 3
expect par20 1
spin K4 -1
expect par41 0
spin K3 100
expect par40 100
spin K1 -25
spin K3 -100
expect par19 0
expect par40 0
tap ENV
expect view 2
# EDIT: Osc (X-Wave, PW)
tap EDIT
expect view 4
spin K1 -67
expect par1 0
spin K2 10
expect par2 40
# LFO: the depths, and the keys switch to LFO routing
tap LFO
expect view 5
spin K2 30
expect par17 55
tapkey b0
expect par13 2
# the route keys go round: Wave II, both (I+II), Wave I
tapkey b0
expect par13 3
tapkey b0
expect par13 1
tapkey b0
expect par13 2
# the filter LFO onto the resonance and back (the third key)
tapkey b2
expect par18 1
tapkey b2
expect par18 0
tapkey b1
expect par15 1
tapkey b8
expect par37 3
wait 100
shot lfo.png
# LFO reset (drone I's filter group, either layer): the LFO back to the start of its cycle (a triangle
# starts at the bottom)
tapkey b4
wait 1000
expect lfo0 >-40
tapkey b4
wait 30
expect lfo0 <-80
# held half a second, the reset key locks the LFO to the pulse's bars (the key stays lit); again: free
key b4 down
wait 700
key b4 up
expect par67 1
key b4 down
wait 700
key b4 up
expect par67 0
# LFO again: LFO mods, the rate mod (KNOB 1 its depth, KNOB 2 the wave that moves it); again: LFO
tap LFO
expect view 6
spin K1 50
expect par68 50
spin K2 1
expect par69 3
spin K1 -50
expect par68 0
# ... and cross-mod's amount (KNOB 3) and the delay LFO's depth (KNOB 4), moved here from Filter 2 and
# Effects 2
spin K3 10
expect par43 50
spin K4 20
expect par66 20
spin K4 -20
tap LFO
expect view 5
# the normal keys (back on Play): partner, sub -2, HP, hard sync, cross-mod
tap HOME
expect view 0
tapkey b0
expect par12 0
tapkey b1
expect par6 2
# the sub key goes round: -2 oct, 1/3, 1/5, -1 oct (then -2 again, for what follows)
tapkey b1
expect par6 3
tapkey b1
expect par6 4
tapkey b1
expect par6 1
tapkey b1
expect par6 2
# PITCH LOCK (the global pair's first key, key 4): the pitch knobs do nothing until it's off again
tapkey b3
expect par74 1
spin K1 5
expect par0 5037
tapkey b3
expect par74 0
# the filter key (drone I's third) goes round: LP, BP, HP
tapkey b2
expect par9 1
tapkey b2
expect par9 2
tapkey b9
expect par44 1
tapkey b10
expect par42 1
wait 100
shot switches.png
# pitch link: drone II keeps its pitch (offset = 4560 - 3837 = 723), KNOB 3 moves the offset, drone I
# carries drone II (pitch link: the links pair's first key, key 9)
tapkey b8
expect par45 1
expect par46 723
spin K3 -1
expect par46 663
spin K1 -1
expect par0 4977
wait 400
expect pitch1 5640
tapkey b8
expect par45 0
expect par21 5640
# ARP: a tap is the pulse on / off (and the page stays); held, its page, without toggling
tap ARP
expect par55 1
expect view 0
press ARP
expect view 10
spin K1 10
expect par56 55
release ARP
expect view 0
expect par55 1
wait 400
shot pulse.png
tap ARP
expect par55 0
# two quick taps: the Swell page, to stay (the swell as it was); another page button leaves it
wait 400
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect view 10
expect par55 0
wait 600
expect view 10
tap HOME
expect view 0
# REC: the motion loop. Record two turns of KNOB 2 (drone I's cutoff, 50 now), 0.3 s apart, then loop:
# it starts from where the recording did, plays the turns on time, comes round again; REC stops it where
# it is
tap REC
expect loop 1
wait 200
spin K2 10
expect par7 750
wait 300
spin K2 10
expect par7 850
wait 300
tap REC
expect loop 2
expect par7 650
wait 300
expect par7 750
wait 300
expect par7 850
wait 300
expect par7 650
wait 200
expect par7 750
wait 100
shot loop.png
tap REC
expect loop 0
wait 600
expect par7 750
spin K2 -10
expect par7 650
# FX: Delay time, Repeats, Delay mix, Reverb mix; again: Reverb type (the delay LFO depth is on LFO mods)
tap FX
expect view 11
spin K1 -10
expect par60 40
spin K2 15
expect par61 50
spin K3 30
expect par62 30
spin K4 10
expect par63 35
wait 100
shot fx.png
tap FX
expect view 12
spin K1 -1
expect par64 1
wait 100
shot fx2.png
tap FX
expect view 11
# the delay LFO's tap: on the LFO page, drone II's filter group, second key
tap LFO
tapkey b9
expect par65 2
tap HOME
expect view 0
# SEQ: Partner; GLO: Setup
tap SEQ
expect view 7
tap GLO
expect view 8
spin K2 10
expect par51 52
wait 100
shot setup.png
# SELECT: the LFO rate, PRESETS (left): Wave I, ALGORITHM (right): Wave II
spin SELECT 10
expect par47 40
spin PRESET 2
expect par48 3
spin ALGO 1
expect par49 2
# MIDI: a note on channel 2 tunes drone II to it exactly
midi 91 3C 64
wait 20
expect par21 6000
# SAVE while playing: the output dips out (20 ms), the write, back (30 ms)
tap SAVE
wait 150
expect store_writes 1
expect dirty 0
# no autosave while the drone plays (a knob moved and back: unsaved again)
spin K1 1
spin K1 -1
expect dirty 1
wait 5000
expect dirty 1
expect store_writes 1
# PLAY again: out over the fade (Fade is 52 now: 2.0 s), then the autosave
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
wait 2500
expect fade 0
wait 4500
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes 2
wavstop
# everything comes back after a reboot
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 4977
expect par21 6000
expect par42 1
expect par44 1
expect par6 2
expect playing 0
# stopped, the screen still shows where the pitches are set (MIDI put drone II on C4)
expect pitch1 6000
# scenes: SAVE held + white key 1 stores (into the flash at once); the key lights
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
expect scenes 1
expect store_writes 3
expect view 0
# the sound is scene 1 (its key blinks), until a knob is turned
expect scene_at 0
spin K1 10
expect scene_at -1
expect par0 5577
spin K2 20
expect par7 850
# a scene doesn't carry the room's settings: the speaker set after storing stays when it's recalled
tap FX
tap FX
spin K2 30
expect par73 30
tap HOME
expect view 0
# white key 1: back to the scene, morphing over the Scene switch time (1.1 s)
tapkey w0
wait 450
expect par7 >670
expect par7 <830
expect par0 >5000
expect par0 <5550
wait 900
expect par7 650
expect par73 30
expect par0 4977
expect scene_at 0
# an empty slot: nothing changes
tapkey w1
expect scenes 1
expect par7 650
# a knob turned during a morph stops it where it is
spin K2 20
tapkey w0
wait 300
spin K4 1
wait 1500
expect par7 >670
wait 100
shot scenes.png
# the scene survives a reboot (the SAVE above wrote it)
reboot
wait 300
expect scenes 1
shot rebooted.png
# hold a white key: a visit. The cutoff moved off the scene (850), key 1 held: there (650) over the Scene
# time; let go: back (850), the same way. A tap stays
spin K2 20
expect par7 850
key w0 down
wait 1500
expect par7 650
expect scene_at 0
key w0 up
wait 1500
expect par7 850
expect scene_at -1
tapkey w0
wait 1500
expect par7 650
